+<p><code>python scripts\workflow.py next --slug workflow-reliability --action CHECK-ID</code> selects only registered argv/cwd. Status returns this controlled command only when ready. A working command is not completion: closing an increment additionally requires due independent verification/review and prerequisite completion.</p>
