.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:62: trailing whitespace.
+<h2>4. Data &amp; contracts</h2>
.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:63: trailing whitespace.
+<p><code>SourceSnapshot</code> needs no workflow. Later <code>ContractBinding</code> explicitly adds current component/check hashes. <code>workflow.json</code> owns forward edges/commands; <code>current-design.json</code> points to history; the ledger owns runtime facts. Replay/status are derived. Own generated outputs do not invalidate source proof.</p>
.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:64: trailing whitespace.
+<p>Metric v2 separates measured regression from completeness. Unknown baseline is not greenfield; stale reports cannot become new measurements. Missing proof fails without imports, exemptions or adoption. Mutation stays 60%; eval stays 0.9. Known-greenfield cycles fail under the existing no-new-cycle rule.</p>
.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:65: trailing whitespace.
+
.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:66: trailing whitespace.
+<h2>5. Decisions &amp; failure behavior</h2>
.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:67: trailing whitespace.
+<ul>
.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:68: trailing whitespace.
+<li><strong>Explicit argv, not shell text:</strong> preserve spaces and package cwd independently of Git root. Node events must identify relevant assertions; syntax, setup, empty suites and timeouts never kill mutants. Unsupported runners remain unavailable.</li>
.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:69: trailing whitespace.
+<li><strong>Observed ownership, not a supervisor:</strong> persist launch intent and actual child events. The spawn-to-record crash gap remains unknown; dead guard/PID age cannot unlock it. Recovery needs supported termination evidence, otherwise stays blocked.</li>
.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:70: trailing whitespace.
+<li><strong>Observed scope, not sandbox:</strong> hashes detect only scoped input changes. Review owns scope completeness. Identity is self-declared; outside-scope writes remain unobserved. Keep owned scratch cleanup, without a product-wide OS-temp ban.</li>
.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:71: trailing whitespace.
+<li><strong>Scoped reopening, not full reset:</strong> changed prerequisites invalidate dependent proof only. Old red/compatibility proof remains historical; retirement requires its admission before deletion, never a later backfill.</li>
.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:72: trailing whitespace.
+<li><strong>Fail closed:</strong> blocked gate exits 1, malformed input 2, lock/recovery conflict 3. Executed children preserve exit/timeout codes and carry a separate structured outcome. Approval is not inferred from silence.</li>
.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:73: trailing whitespace.
+</ul>
.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:74: trailing whitespace.
+
.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:75: trailing whitespace.
+<h2>6. Test strategy — proposed, not run</h2>
.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:76: trailing whitespace.
+<p><strong>AC01–02:</strong> real ESM/CJS repositories without workflow artifacts; spaced argv/nested cwd; classifications and stale-report failure. <strong>AC03–05:</strong> no-spawn sentinel, forward-edge rules, live-child guard crash, uncertain spawn, recovery evidence and scoped resume. <strong>AC06–08:</strong> failure evaluations, temporal retirement, current delegated contract and research supersession. Separate fresh-agent diagnosis withholds cause/oracle from neutral inputs and records available accesses; shared storage is not isolation. Exposure or insufficient records leaves blindness unverified. <strong>AC09:</strong> independent per-increment verification/review and final native/eval regressions. Required missing proof remains incomplete, never waived.</p>
.ai/workflow-reliability/design.html:77: trailing whitespace.
+</body>
